{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The metric screw assortment felt like a useful next choice because its smaller sizes and flat heads could complement my recent fastener kit for small assembly jobs.",
    "The magnetic hooks matched my recent interest in convenient hanging and organization, so that connection made sense even though I would skip another set now."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The polishing compound, inspection camera, dispensing bottles and conductive tape each serve a specific task I have not shown a need for; buying fasteners does not mean I have those projects underway.",
    "The trash bags, wood cleaner and spa glove did not connect to my current small hardware and organization needs."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The recommendations seemed to treat a broad connection to tools or workshop supplies as enough, when I need an item to fit a particular job.",
    "My interest in magnetic hooks seemed to be taken as a reason to offer more of them, even though my two recent sets may already cover that need."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Complementary details matter: smaller metric sizes and a different screw head give me a reason to consider another assortment.",
    "I rarely choose something without a clear use for it now; a related product needs to fill a gap rather than simply resemble something I recently picked up."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my hardware and organization interests but often stretched them into unrelated tasks or needs I may already have covered."
}"}
